o has the  money  what's the best way to remortgage with a  broker all right last question nicole  ripple i'm just turning 16.  congratulations for being on the channel  and i really really really want to get  into property obviously i can't own  property as a child but i will gather  capital for the next two years what's  the best strategy to invest in property  once i turn 18.  um okay so i had the same problem i  started out when i was 17. i was  thinking i can't wait to turn 18 i can  buy houses and then someone told me you  need to be 21 to get a buy to let  mortgage i thought i'm not waiting four  years so then i got super creative and  as a teenager if you're 16 17 18 19 you  don't necessarily have to buy houses to  make money from them you can package and  sell deals  you can control properties there's a lot  of things you can do as an entrepreneur  without having to actually own a  property so i would start doing that and  then when you're old enough or if you  can pull a joint venture partner start  building your own portfolio hope you  found this video helpful ask your  comments some questions below i'll do my  best to answer thanks for watching peace  out god bless

